  "description": "The main window may only call the app's own commands: app info, the vault (status, setup, confirm recovery key saved, unlock, lock, change password, new password after a recovery unlock, new recovery key, delete all data), screenshot protection (allow for 10 minutes, protect now), the alpha's data commands and backups (save, list, pick, check, restore), and round 15's repeating things, lists, Work / Home / Both and While you were away. No plugin permissions: the dialog plugin is only called from Rust, and there is no shell, fs, http or opener access.",
